            verdict = "allow",
            body = "MGS1040 printed one line per occurrence and repeated its stale-binary paragraph for every unknown key.\n"
                + "\n"
                + "- Each unknown key prints once, by dotted path (`watch.env`), with every line it appears on and any suggestion or rename.\n"
                + "- The version gap is stated once, with the running version and the workspace floor, followed by runnable fixes: self update, the checkout's go-build, and the `GOEXPERIMENT=jsonv2 go run -trimpath ./cmd/magus run go-build --no-cache .` bootstrap for a dev build.\n"
                + "- The workspace that holds the file decides the relative path and the source-tree fixes, not the cwd, so `--root` and user-global files render correctly.\n"
