                + "\n"
                + "- The workspace command and write rules now run on anything but a built-in deny.\n"
                + "- A workspace deny replaces a built-in ask. A workspace advise on an ask is dropped, like every other notice on an ask.\n"
                + "- Tests: a Go test pins the chained line becoming a deny, and gh.buzz pins an admin merge anywhere on the line, joined by `;`, `&&` or `||` or inside a subshell. A queued merge stays silent.",
        },
        Fixture{
